<title>GUATEMALA: Guatemala March coffee exports edge up vs March 96.</title>
<headline>Guatemala March coffee exports edge up vs March 96.</headline>
<dateline>GUATEMALA CITY 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemala exported 577,621 60-kil bags of coffee in March the National Coffee Association (Anacafe) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Exports for the month were five percent higher than March 1996 exports of 547,489 60-kilo bags, Anacafe president Julio Arrivillaga told Reuters.</p>
<p>March exports were 14 percent lower than in February this year when 672,982 60-kilo bags of coffee were exported.  </p>
<p>Arrivillaga said total exports for the current harvest, Oct. 1 through March 31 were 2,738,401 60-kilo bags.</p>
<p>((By Fiona Ortiz, Guatemala City bureau +502 251-5718))</p>
